      "message": "Change was merged into android15-6.1, then cherry picked into android15-6.6. Despite passing all presubmits, it caused a build breakage on android15-6.6 due to riscv having a different gki_defconfig on 6.6 (vs 6.1 is a symlink to arm64). \n\nThere were build issues in both patches which prevented building without the config enabled 😕. Therefore I reverted the patches from both 6.6 and 6.1, and this is the resubmit with fixes.\n\nChanges in this patch described in the comment here: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/2983418/comments/116c55e4_99ae9cc8",
